Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Framerate 30
Set TypingSpeed 20ms
Set Padding 12

Type "env -u NO_COLOR TERM=xterm-256color COLORTERM=truecolor target/release/synesthesia demo --seed 42 --mode ansi --theme phosphor"
Enter
Sleep 8s
Type "2"
Sleep 3s
Type "1"
Sleep 2s
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
